{"title":"Poor Unfortunate Souls (랩.ver)","artist":"The Descendents","sourceId":"reference:TpE1UKwjAHFRBbJ4jW9g","sourceHash":"6d6d1d4584d9043202e1ea5a97aaeac516f2ba7ceae87a352d82497b0c970618","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":4.76,"end":7.4,"text":"I admit that in the past I've been a nasty","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.4,"end":9.48,"text":"They weren't kidding when they called me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":9.48,"end":10.43,"text":"Well, a witch?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":10.43,"end":11.4,"text":"But you'll find that nowadays","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":11.4,"end":13.07,"text":"I've mended all my ways","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":13.07,"end":14.15,"text":"Repented, seen the light","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":14.15,"end":15.22,"text":"And made a switch","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":15.22,"end":17.61,"text":"And I fortunately know a little magic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":17.61,"end":20.25,"text":"It's a talent that I always have possessed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":20.25,"end":21.91,"text":"And here lately, please don't laugh","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":21.91,"end":23.17,"text":"I use it on behalf","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":23.17,"end":25.51,"text":"Of the miserable, lonely, and depressed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":25.51,"end":28.51,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":28.66,"end":30.18,"text":"In pain, in need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":30.18,"end":31.89,"text":"This one longing to be thinner","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":31.89,"end":33.17,"text":"That one wants to get the girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":33.17,"end":34.3,"text":"And do I help them?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":34.3,"end":35.83,"text":"Yes, indeed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":35.83,"end":38.31,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":38.31,"end":40.81,"text":"So sad, so true","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":40.81,"end":42.18,"text":"They come flocking to my cauldron","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":42.18,"end":43.6,"text":"Crying: \"Spells, Ursula, please!\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":43.6,"end":44.85,"text":"And I help them","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":44.85,"end":47.85,"text":"Yes, I do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":50.95,"end":52.25,"text":"Now it's happened once or twice","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":52.25,"end":53.45,"text":"Someone couldn't pay the price","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":53.45,"end":54.58,"text":"And I'm afraid","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":54.58,"end":56.22,"text":"I had to rake 'em 'cross the coals","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":56.22,"end":57.42,"text":"Yes I've had the odd complaint","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":57.42,"end":58.93,"text":"But on the whole I've been a saint","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":58.93,"end":60.88,"text":"To those poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":60.88,"end":63.83,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":63.83,"end":65.7,"text":"In pain, in need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":65.7,"end":67.42,"text":"This one longing to be thinner","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":67.42,"end":69.03999999999999,"text":"That one wants to get the girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":69.03999999999999,"end":70.08,"text":"And do I help them?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":70.08,"end":71.57,"text":"Yes, indeed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":71.57,"end":73.86,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":73.86,"end":76.59,"text":"So sad, so true","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":76.59,"end":77.73,"text":"They come flocking to my cauldron","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":77.73,"end":79.27,"text":"Crying: \"Spells, Ursula, please!\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":79.27,"end":80.36,"text":"And I help them","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":80.36,"end":83.36,"text":"Yes, I do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":86.65,"end":89.23,"text":"The men up there don't like a lot of blabber","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":89.23,"end":91.55,"text":"They think a girl who gossips is a bore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":91.55,"end":93.14,"text":"Yes, on land it's much preferred","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":93.14,"end":94.7,"text":"For ladies not to say a word","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":94.7,"end":97.25999999999999,"text":"And after all dear, what is idle prattle for?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":97.25999999999999,"end":99.97,"text":"They're not all that impressed with conversation","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":99.97,"end":102.41,"text":"True gentlemen avoid it when they can","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":102.41,"end":104.28,"text":"But they dote and swoon and fawn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":104.28,"end":105.55,"text":"On a lady who's withdrawn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":105.55,"end":106.81,"text":"It's she who holds her tongue","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":106.81,"end":107.83,"text":"Come on, girl!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":107.83,"end":110.11,"text":"Poor unfortunate soul","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":110.11,"end":111.07,"text":"Go ahead!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":111.07,"end":112.49000000000001,"text":"Make your choice","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":112.49000000000001,"end":113.78999999999999,"text":"I'm a very busy woman","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":113.78999999999999,"end":114.89,"text":"And I haven't got all day","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":114.89,"end":115.92,"text":"It won't cost much","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":115.92,"end":117.53,"text":"Just your voice!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":117.53,"end":119.88,"text":"Poor unfortunate soul","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":119.88,"end":122.45,"text":"It's sad, but true","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":122.45,"end":123.54,"text":"If you want to cross the bridge","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":123.54,"end":125.2,"text":"You've got to pay the toll","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":125.2,"end":126.29,"text":"Take a gulp and take a breath","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":126.29,"end":127.02,"text":"And go ahead","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":127.02,"end":128.18,"text":"Come on, girl!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":128.18,"end":130.15,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":130.15,"end":132.62,"text":"In pain, in need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":132.62,"end":133.61,"text":"This one longing to be thinner","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":133.61,"end":135.52,"text":"That one wants to get the girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":135.52,"end":136.39,"text":"And do I help them?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":136.39,"end":137.77,"text":"Yes, indeed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":137.77,"end":138.65,"text":"Come on, girl!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":138.65,"end":140.15,"text":"Poor unfortunate souls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":140.15,"end":142.12,"text":"In pain, in need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":142.12,"end":144.35,"text":"They come flocking to my cauldron","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":144.35,"end":145.4,"text":"Crying: \"Spells, Ursula, please!\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":145.4,"end":146.68,"text":"And I help them","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":146.68,"end":149.68,"text":"Yes I do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}